    "media:imagetext": "BREAKFAST SERVICE\nCHILLED ORANGE JUICE\nENTREE SELECTIONS\nOMELETTE FLORENTINE\nA tasty Omelette filled with Spinach, Onions and Mushrooms\nin a creamy Cheese Sauce. Accompanied with Canadian\nBacon and a Fresh Fruit Starter.\nNORTHWEST BERRY PANCAKES\nTender Buttermilk Pancakes rolled around a filling of\nNorthwest Blackberries. Accompanied with Syrup,\nCanadian Bacon and a Fresh Fruit Starter.\nFOR THE LIGHTER APPETITE\nA seasonal Fresh Fruit Plate served with\ncreamy Yogurt and Cold Cereal.\nBreakfast Pastries served with\nContinental Butter and Preserves.\nWe apologize if occasionally your choice is not available.\nIF UNITED\n2006.059.307.025\nME400-4\nB03/V01",
